MedOrbits -- Storage Ignore Rules

Keep runtime data, uploaded files, generated artifacts, and backups

out of Git by default.

Ignore all storage contents by default.

Preserve Git configuration and directory documentation.

!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
!README.md

Preserve intended runtime directories.

!tmp/
!uploads/
!documents/
!applications/
!profiles/
!employer-documents/
!generated/
!exports/
!quarantine/
!backups/

Ignore all contents inside runtime directories.

tmp/*
uploads/*
documents/*
applications/*
profiles/*
employer-documents/*
generated/*
exports/*
quarantine/*
backups/*

Preserve directory placeholders.

!tmp/.gitkeep
!uploads/.gitkeep
!documents/.gitkeep
!applications/.gitkeep
!profiles/.gitkeep
!employer-documents/.gitkeep
!generated/.gitkeep
!exports/.gitkeep
!quarantine/.gitkeep
!backups/.gitkeep